---
version: 2.0.2
title: catalogue: grice/cannot-read without a project
---
error[grice/cannot-read]: Can't find the project

grice lints the project of the nearest `gleam.toml`, but there's none in
`/home/me/app` or any directory above it.

Hint: Run grice from inside a Gleam project, such as in the directory of
its `gleam.toml`.


